                • Thermal decomposition: 2Pb(NO₃)₂ &rarr; 2PbO (yellow residue) + 4NO₂&uarr; (brown fumes) + O₂&uarr;. <span class="step-marks">[1 Mark]</span>
              </div>
            </div>
